          "snippet": "We now turn to odd elastodynamics and study wave propagation in the overdamped regime in which energy injection due to activity can counteract dissipation [2,19,25,26]. A distinctive feature of odd elastic waves is that they exist even when the bulk and shear moduli are vanishingly small.",
